DEBUG:openai:api_version=None data='{"model": "gpt-4", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are an education specialist. Create a detailed webquest about German Geography using the SAMR model and adheres to ISTE standards.This lesson plan should include at least a title, lesson objectives, materials, assessment and a worksheet. The SAMR model is defined as follows:\\n\\nThe SAMR model offers a method of seeing how computer technology might impact teaching and learning. It shows a progression that adopters of educational technology often follow as they progress through teaching and learning with technology. SAMR stands for Substitution, Augmentation, Modification, and Redefinition.\\n\\nThe lesson plan should include detailed instructions for the teacher to follow. The lesson plan should be complete and comprehensive, meaning the teacher would need no additional resources in order to use the lesson.Provide detailed instructions for the teacher, including introductory activities to engage students and           concluding remarks or activities to wrap up the lesson.The lesson structure should encompass a title, lesson overview, learning objectives and outcomes, necessary materials, diverse activities for students and assessment questions. The activities should range from discussions to hands-on exercises.Furthermore, a meticulously detailed worksheet should be integral to the plan. This worksheet should offer specific questions, diagrams, and content tailored for student engagement.It should be about 1200 words, detailed and appropriate for grade 11 and a class of 15 students. The cultural makeup of the students includes W, h, i, t, e,the Socioeconomic level of the students is Medium with the Experiential Type of Literate learners. The students include Not Disabled, Not ELL, and Not Gifted. The lesson should fit the state of Arizona standards."}]}' message='Post details'
